{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ullq2givmknaywc6", "title": "101.基于Accelerate进行分布式训练", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ue8a91f2c\" id=\"ue8a91f2c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4934ba46\" id=\"u4934ba46\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1745804257839-3ee87e99-7d8d-4fa3-ab70-9a9845a87581.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22accelerate-demo.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A545%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0d3f76dc-f7e3-4b2f-aece-98abf20ddc2%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u99606199%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd00ce8d\" id=\"ubd00ce8d\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9fb7d65d\" id=\"u9fb7d65d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u369c84d5\" id=\"u369c84d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1624ae2\" id=\"ue1624ae2\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u63ba6d58\" id=\"u63ba6d58\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc3ce028\" id=\"ucc3ce028\">随着模型变得越来越大，并行性已经成为在有限硬件上训练更大模型和加速训练速度的策略，增加了数个数量级。在 Hugging Face，我们创建了</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf1a3beef\" id=\"uf1a3beef\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6859db0\" id=\"uf6859db0\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u66349d92\" id=\"u66349d92\"> 加速</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u9018ff84\" id=\"u9018ff84\">库，以帮助用户在任何类型的分布式设置上轻松训练</span><span data-lake-id=\"u358da22e\" id=\"u358da22e\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u673defb2\" id=\"u673defb2\"> Transformers 模型，无论是在一台机器上的多个 GPU 还是在多个机器上的多个 GPU。在本教程中，了解如何自定义您的原生 PyTorch 训练循环，以启用分布式环境中的训练。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u527c6dac\" id=\"u527c6dac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17a0231d\" id=\"u17a0231d\">官方文档：</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate/index\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u24edfbb0\" id=\"u24edfbb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6ed4758\" id=\"ue6ed4758\">https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate/index</span></a></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"loeig\" id=\"loeig\"><a href=\"#设置\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0579a5d5\" id=\"u0579a5d5\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue9c5e424\" id=\"ue9c5e424\">设置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1121b08a\" id=\"u1121b08a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98f31c89\" id=\"u98f31c89\">通过安装</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2b848c9a\" id=\"u2b848c9a\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud276d9c4\" id=\"ud276d9c4\"> 加速开始:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u74281fc5\" id=\"u74281fc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61502ad6\" id=\"u61502ad6\">然后导入并创建</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5a23fd20\" id=\"u5a23fd20\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13ecc209\" id=\"u13ecc209\">Accelerator</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6b504d48\" id=\"u6b504d48\">对象。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6164cf44\" id=\"u6164cf44\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0cae75d\" id=\"ue0cae75d\">Accelerator</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u55523023\" id=\"u55523023\">将自动检测您的分布式设置类型，并初始化所有必要的训练组件。您不需要显式地将模型放在设备上。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20accelerate%20import%20Accelerator%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20accelerator%20%3D%20Accelerator()%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eiUxs%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Pxvcs\" id=\"Pxvcs\"><a href=\"#准备加速\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1bcb627b\" id=\"u1bcb627b\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1493a2e4\" id=\"u1493a2e4\">准备加速</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u253fb89a\" id=\"u253fb89a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a87ea05\" id=\"u6a87ea05\">下一步是将所有相关的训练对象传递给</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1f941d2e\" id=\"u1f941d2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab44c366\" id=\"uab44c366\">prepare</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0e1f180\" id=\"ub0e1f180\">方法。这包括您的训练和评估 DataLoader、一个模型和一个优化器:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20train_dataloader%2C%20eval_dataloader%2C%20model%2C%20optimizer%20%3D%20accelerator.prepare(%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20train_dataloader%2C%20eval_dataloader%2C%20model%2C%20optimizer%5Cn...%20)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JvS3H%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"hgnOq\" id=\"hgnOq\"><a href=\"#反向传播\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u23d73f3d\" id=\"u23d73f3d\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue85de114\" id=\"ue85de114\">反向传播</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2dc4eb8c\" id=\"u2dc4eb8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0710c44\" id=\"uf0710c44\">最后一步是用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5e5158c5\" id=\"u5e5158c5\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf6785722\" id=\"uf6785722\"> 加速的</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud4a37add\" id=\"ud4a37add\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72373f67\" id=\"u72373f67\">backward</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u199ac17e\" id=\"u199ac17e\">方法替换训练循环中的典型</span><code data-lake-id=\"u930b4c3f\" id=\"u930b4c3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbaeafd0\" id=\"udbaeafd0\">loss.backward()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udd8ab9d7\" id=\"udd8ab9d7\">:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20for%20epoch%20in%20range(num_epochs)%3A%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20for%20batch%20in%20train_dataloader%3A%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20accelerator.backward(loss)%5Cn%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lr_scheduler.step()%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20progress_bar.update(1)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s0Jx1%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucbc9f493\" id=\"ucbc9f493\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3594c5c3\" id=\"u3594c5c3\">如您在下面的代码中所见，您只需要添加四行额外的代码到您的训练循环中即可启用分布式训练！</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B%20from%20accelerate%20import%20Accelerator%5Cn%20%20from%20transformers%20import%20AdamW%2C%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification%2C%20get_scheduler%5Cn%5Cn%2B%20accelerator%20%3D%20Accelerator()%5Cn%5Cn%20%20model%20%3D%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(checkpoint%2C%20num_labels%3D2)%5Cn%20%20optimizer%20%3D%20AdamW(model.parameters()%2C%20lr%3D3e-5)%5Cn%5Cn-%20device%20%3D%20torch.device(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%20if%20torch.cuda.is_available()%20else%20torch.device(%5C%22cpu%5C%22)%5Cn-%20model.to(device)%5Cn%5Cn%2B%20train_dataloader%2C%20eval_dataloader%2C%20model%2C%20optimizer%20%3D%20accelerator.prepare(%5Cn%2B%20%20%20%20%20train_dataloader%2C%20eval_dataloader%2C%20model%2C%20optimizer%5Cn%2B%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20num_epochs%20%3D%203%5Cn%20%20num_training_steps%20%3D%20num_epochs%20*%20len(train_dataloader)%5Cn%20%20lr_scheduler%20%3D%20get_scheduler(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22linear%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer%3Doptimizer%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20num_warmup_steps%3D0%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20num_training_steps%3Dnum_training_steps%5Cn%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20progress_bar%20%3D%20tqdm(range(num_training_steps))%5Cn%5Cn%20%20model.train()%5Cn%20%20for%20epoch%20in%20range(num_epochs)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20batch%20in%20train_dataloader%3A%5Cn-%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20batch%20%3D%20%7Bk%3A%20v.to(device)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20batch.items()%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20outputs%20%3D%20model(**batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20outputs.loss%5Cn-%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20loss.backward()%5Cn%2B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20accelerator.backward(loss)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lr_scheduler.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20progress_bar.update(1)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MIevD%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"x2wtc\" id=\"x2wtc\"><a href=\"#训练\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub9d8b308\" id=\"ub9d8b308\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u529321bd\" id=\"u529321bd\">训练</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u30b522ed\" id=\"u30b522ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2000f44\" id=\"ua2000f44\">在添加了相关代码行后，可以在脚本或笔记本（如 Colaboratory）中启动训练。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"IewZj\" id=\"IewZj\"><a href=\"#用脚本训练\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3b005bfa\" id=\"u3b005bfa\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue149e8e7\" id=\"ue149e8e7\">用脚本训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub2f022e8\" id=\"ub2f022e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u945d6a74\" id=\"u945d6a74\">如果您从脚本中运行训练，请运行以下命令以创建和保存配置文件:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u43f13784\" id=\"u43f13784\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3722b6bb\" id=\"u3722b6bb\">然后使用以下命令启动训练:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22accelerate%20launch%20train.py%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yHFaG%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"iVBzO\" id=\"iVBzO\"><a href=\"#用笔记本训练\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uec70e53a\" id=\"uec70e53a\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u177b33d4\" id=\"u177b33d4\">用笔记本训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub99d7c1a\" id=\"ub99d7c1a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a20373c\" id=\"u1a20373c\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua48dbdcb\" id=\"ua48dbdcb\"> 加速还可以在笔记本中运行，如果您计划使用 Colaboratory 的 TPU，则可在其中运行。将负责训练的所有代码包装在一个函数中，并将其传递给</span><code data-lake-id=\"u72051e8a\" id=\"u72051e8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub63eecd5\" id=\"ub63eecd5\">notebook_launcher</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u28c2b3c7\" id=\"u28c2b3c7\">:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20accelerate%20import%20notebook_launcher%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20notebook_launcher(training_function)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bfo1I%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uaefd2dec\" id=\"uaefd2dec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89be601f\" id=\"u89be601f\">有关</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd4c3e7\" id=\"u1dd4c3e7\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua2ff64b8\" id=\"ua2ff64b8\"> 加速及其丰富功能的更多信息，请参阅</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucf007c80\" id=\"ucf007c80\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf017f701\" id=\"uf017f701\">文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u714d5ec3\" id=\"u714d5ec3\">。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 695, "description": "示例代码📎accelerate-demo.ppt注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压随着模型变得越来越大，并行性已经成为在有限硬件上训练更大模型和加速训练速度的策略，增加了数个数量级。在 Hugging Face，我们创建了🤗 加速库，以帮助用户在任何类型的分布式设置上轻松训练🤗 Tran...", "updated_at": "2025-04-28T01:38:34.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-28T01:37:37.000Z", "id": 217435891, "status": 1}